# Ashraf Project – General Engineering Rule

## 1. Project Scope & Mission

- **Project Name:** Ashraf Project – Courier Business Platform
- **Mission:** Deliver a scalable, affordable, and transparent courier platform for small businesses, with seamless merchant experience, robust tracking, and operational efficiency.

---

## 2. Technology Stack

### Frontend
- **Framework:** Next.js 14+ (App Router)
- **Language:** TypeScript
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS (with Headless UI and shadcn/ui components)
- **State Management:** Zustand (client), React Query (server)
- **Forms:** React Hook Form + Zod
- **Charts:** Recharts or Chart.js
- **Maps:** Google Maps JavaScript API
- **PDFs:** React-PDF
- **Testing:** Vitest + GitHub Actions
- **Hosting:** Vercel

### Backend & Auth
- **Platform:** Supabase (PostgreSQL, Auth, Storage)
- **API:** Vercel Serverless Functions (preferred) or Node.js 20+ (Express.js, TypeScript)
- **API Docs:** OpenAPI 3.0 (Swagger UI)
- **Validation:** Joi or Zod
- **Rate Limiting:** express-rate-limit + Redis
- **CORS:** Secure configuration

### Mobile (Courier App)
- **Framework:** React Native (Expo)
- **Language:** TypeScript
- **Navigation:** React Navigation 6
- **Camera:** Expo Camera
- **Location:** Expo Location
- **Barcode:** Expo Barcode Scanner
- **Push Notifications:** Expo Notifications

### Integrations
- **Payments:** Stripe
- **Shopify:** OAuth 2.0, webhooks, real-time sync

---

## 3. Core Features & Functionality

- **User Authentication:** Secure login, account creation, email verification, optional 2FA, RBAC (Merchant, Courier, Admin, Super Admin), JWT-based sessions.
- **Shipment Management:** Create shipments, input package details, real-time quote, label purchase, PDF label generation (4x6", barcode/QR, tracking number), bulk operations.
- **Shopify Integration:** OAuth, real-time order sync, pre-fill shipment forms, direct fulfillment, webhook support.
- **Drop-off & Tracking:** Map of drop-off locations, real-time tracking (multi-state: Label Created, Scanned, Out for Delivery, Delivered, Failed), route optimization, GPS tracking, estimated delivery windows.
- **Proof of Delivery:** Mobile photo capture, GPS/timestamp, digital signature (optional), instant merchant notification.
- **Analytics & Reporting:** Merchant dashboard, admin analytics, custom/exportable reports, real-time system monitoring.

---

## 4. Architecture & Non-Functional Requirements

- **Microservices:** Modular, stateless, horizontally scalable.
- **Performance:** <2s page load, optimized queries, CDN for static assets.
- **Reliability:** 99.9% uptime target, robust error handling, automated testing.
- **Security:** OWASP Top 10, secure API keys, RBAC, encrypted storage, PCI compliance for payments.
- **Accessibility:** All UI must be accessible (ARIA, keyboard, color contrast).
- **Responsiveness:** Mobile-first, fully responsive layouts.
- **Documentation:** Up-to-date README, OpenAPI docs, and STYLE_GUIDE.md.

---

## 5. UI/UX & Component Standards

- **Design System:** All UI must use shadcn/ui components ([shadcn/ui GitHub](https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui)), extended as needed.
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS only; no custom CSS unless necessary.
- **Component Structure:** Functional components, descriptive naming, early returns, no dead code or TODOs.
- **Premium Transitions:** Use subtle, modern transitions (see premium-transitions-and-effects.mdc), always test for accessibility and performance.

---

## 6. Automation & Validation

- **Linting:** Enforce naming, scoping, and accessibility via ESLint/Stylelint.
- **CI/CD:** All code must pass tests and lint checks in GitHub Actions before merging.
- **Environment:** All secrets/API keys via environment variables, never committed.

---

## 7. Enforcement

- **Code Reviews:** Must verify adherence to this rule file and all referenced standards.
- **Deviation:** Any deviation must be documented and approved by project lead.

---

**By following this rule, the Ashraf Project will maintain a scalable, secure, and maintainable codebase, delivering a premium experience for all users.**
